                                "sense_id": "f4db2456-9a54-318d-bc32-54ac32b499fd",
                                "text": "All packed malware consists of the unpacker code and packed data, which typically look like random data. The benefit of packed malware, from a malicious author's point of view, is that it cannot be analyzed until it is properly unpacked."
